## Advance, revisit, pause, and escalate

Advance only after two distinct qualifying full-scope independent passes at O007 revision 2 / O007-C1. Delayed success is separate and cannot be inferred from acquisition. If a prerequisite fails, execute its one prepared repair route and return to instruction. If the supported answer remains incomplete after two hints, show the missing step and stop treating it as a check. After two unsuccessful fresh independent attempts in one session, pause assessment, revisit the worked explanation, and arrange a fresh prepared attempt; do not drill exposed questions until they appear fluent. Close an interrupted session without acquisition claims.

If the notes conflict, ingestion state becomes blocked/stale, or a cited source claim cannot support a key, stop the affected block and route a `note_issue` to ingest with course 2026_2027/Winter_Semester/Comparative_Economics, note/heading, ingestion revision 2 and exact conflicting claim. If a learner offers a plausible answer outside prepared criteria, a key is ambiguous, a lesson explanation/teaching bridge is missing, or fresh variants are exhausted, route `plan_issue` to plan with O007, revision 2, O007-C1, P002/V002, item ID/version and exact missing decision. Continue unaffected objectives only if their prerequisites are satisfied. Teach owns actual evidence; this file supplies no learner outcome.

